==Battleground==
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Blanka (Enemy)|Blanka]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

